{"step_index":886,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T02:27:41Z","thinking":"**Analyzing Backgrounds**\n\nI've determined that `assets/backgrounds/bg_home.svg` is purely a background image, featuring a warm bedroom scene complete with a wall, window, picture, floor, rug, and wardrobe. Importantly, it doesn't include any characters, making it solely a contextual element.\n\n\n**Identifying the Solution**\n\nI've pinpointed the issue in `index.html`: the Bé Bin character is hardcoded within `assets/scenes/intro_act1_wardrobe.svg`. This is incorrect. The `intro-art-frame` needs to be structured with a separate background image devoid of the character, allowing for dynamic character integration. Now, I'm focusing on the intended structure of the intro scene to ensure proper separation of the background and character elements.\n\n\n**Refining Structure**\n\nI'm now examining the `index.html` structure more closely. I see the background image is incorrectly included inline in the HTML within both the intro scene and gameplay scene. This confirms the need to refactor the structure, separating the character mount from the background image. The background is being hardcoded to the background-image style. I'm focusing on generalizing the background implementation.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"/**\\n * character-renderer.js\\n * Multi-layer Dynamic Character Renderer for Bé Bin (viewBox=\\\"0 0 400 600\\\")\\n * \\n * Quản lý đồng bộ toàn bộ các mount [data-bin-character] trên trang.\\n * Đảm bảo 100% nhân vật Bé Bin xuất phát từ 1 nguồn duy nhất (Multi-layer Overlay).\\n */\\n\\nclass BinCharacterRenderer {\\n    constructor() {\\n        this.currentOutfit = {\\n            shirt: null,\\n            pants: null,\\n            shoes: null,\\n            seatbelt: null\\n        };\\n\\n        this.assetMap = {\\n            base: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/bin_base.svg',\\n            shirts: {\\n                yellow: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shirts/shirt_yellow.svg',\\n                soft: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shirts/shirt_yellow.svg',\\n                blue: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shirts/shirt_blue.svg'\\n            },\\n            pants: {\\n                blue: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/pants/pants_blue.svg',\\n                soft: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/pants/pants_blue.svg',\\n                orange: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/pants/pants_orange.svg'\\n            },\\n            shoes: {\\n                velcro: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shoes/shoes_blue_velcro.svg',\\n                blue_velcro: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shoes/shoes_blue_velcro.svg',\\n                white_laces: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shoes/shoes_white_laces.svg'\\n            },\\n            seatbelt: {\\n                fastened: 'assets/characters/bin/layers/seatbelt_fastened.svg',\\n                none: null\\n            }\\n        };\\n\\n        this.containers = new Set();\\n\\n        // Tự động mount khi DOM sẵn sàng\\n        if (document.readyState === 'loading') {\\n            document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => this.mountAll());\\n        } else {\\n            this.mountAll();\\n        }\\n    }\\n\\n    mountAll() {\\n        document.querySelectorAll('[data-bin-character]').forEach(el => {\\n            this.renderTo(el);\\n        });\\n    }\\n\\n   \n<truncated 4382 bytes>","Description":"\"Nâng cấp character-renderer.js tự động mount và đồng bộ mọi [data-bin-character] trên trang\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Demo.plane\\\\js\\\\character-renderer.js\"","toolAction":"\"Writing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Update character-renderer.js with mountAll\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
