{"step_index":898,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T02:28:43Z","thinking":"**Implementing Initial Rendering**\n\nI've just adjusted the `init()` function. I've integrated a call to `ensureBinRenderer()` right at the start within `init()`. The aim here is to make sure both mounts are rendered instantly upon initial load. This should optimize the initial user experience.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"replace_file_content","args":{"AllowMultiple":"false","Description":"\"Thêm ensureBinRenderer vào init() để mount Bé Bin ngay khi tải trang\"","EndLine":"1220","Instruction":"\"Thêm ensureBinRenderer() vào init() trong index.html\"","ReplacementContent":"\"    bindSimpleActivities();\\n    ensureBinRenderer();\\n    showActivity(1, {force:true});\\n    console.log('[APP READY] 13-activity controller loaded');\\n  }\"","StartLine":"1208","TargetContent":"\"    bindSimpleActivities();\\n    showActivity(1, {force:true});\\n    console.log('[APP READY] 13-activity controller loaded');\\n  }\"","TargetFile":"\"c:\\\\Demo.plane\\\\index.html\"","toolAction":"\"Editing file\"","toolSummary":"\"Call ensureBinRenderer in init\""}}]}
